{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOBODY LOOKS TWICE AT THE GUY FIXING THEIR TOILET. THAT'S THE POINT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 THE SETUP Redemption Prison is a lie. Warden Kozlov's celebrated &quot;Born Again&quot; program turns hardened criminals into model citizens\u2014or so the world believes. The Agency knows better. Behind the miracle is a conspiracy funded by millions in shadow money. That's where you come in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc64 YOUR COVER You're The Fixer\u2014a ghost operative hiding in plain sight as a maintenance worker. Your toolbox is your arsenal. Your cover is perfect. Nobody notices the handyman with a wrench. They think you're here to repair pipes. You're here to dismantle their entire operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 MEET WINSTON You're not alone. Winston is your drone partner\u2014your hacker, your scout, your intel source. Keep him calm, leverage his skills, and when the pressure's on, he'll come through. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/72d0b2e161ce8b6c3bfdced9e37950f4.poster.webp?t=1759257276\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/72d0b2e161ce8b6c3bfdced9e37950f4.webp?t=1759257276\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=150 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 SOLVE WITH YOUR HANDS Built for VR from the ground up, FIXER UNDERCOVER turns the prison into your puzzle playground. Grip a power drill and bypass locks. Use an angle grinder to cut through &quot;faulty&quot; vents. With hyper-realistic tool physics and haptic feedback, you'll feel every screw turn, every wire snap, every mechanism click into place. The prison is one massive environmental puzzle. Observe. Improvise. Combine. That broken electrical box? Reroute it. That leaking pipe? Follow it to a server room. Nothing is just scenery. Everything is a clue. And there's no single solution\u2014only clever ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/d4fcc199d3fbebca679df774030f7e26.poster.webp?t=1759257276\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/d4fcc199d3fbebca679df774030f7e26.webp?t=1759257276\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf YOUR MISSION Infiltrate. Impovise. Expose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From former escape room designers who understand that the best puzzles make you feel like a genius when you solve them.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/6af99a6b4726b6f4da4681b78d292d05.poster.webp?t=1759257276\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/6af99a6b4726b6f4da4681b78d292d05.webp?t=1759257276\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=150 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3102370?t=1759257276","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3102370?t=1759257276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/da87ffa3a3ca5d29428d2e2193c1499f9aa2bcb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759257276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/da87ffa3a3ca5d29428d2e2193c14